"and security concerns, but you will lose all customizations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-install-software.rst:220
#: 74561b664c6b480e8c8a39f002db8d0f
msgid ""
"**Full revert.** This is appropriate for both misconfigurations and security "
"concerns, and it can preserve your customizations. However, it is a bit more "
"complex."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-install-software.rst:223
#: 25e91f8353534714811202944116a60c
msgid "Root revert"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-install-software.rst:225
#: 85dc5957ba2f40babdd1d02bb4499491
msgid ""
"This command will roll back any changes made *during the last time the "
"template was run, but* **not** *before.* This means that if you have already "
"restarted the template, using this command is unlikely to help, and you’ll "
"likely want to reinstall it from the repository instead. On the other hand, "
"if the template is already broken or compromised, it won’t hurt to try "
"reverting first. Just make sure to **back up** all of your data and changes "
"first!"
msgstr ""

